// v319: 操作シートからのワンタップ日付移動（今日/明日/来週）。連日予定は期間の長さを保って移動
function evActMoveTo(id, addDays) {
  var e = findEvent(id);
  if (!e) return;
  closeEventActions();
  var nd = evYmd(evAddDays(new Date(), addDays));
  if (e.endDate && e.date) {
    var p1 = e.date.split('-'), p2 = nd.split('-');
    var d1 = new Date(parseInt(p1[0],10), parseInt(p1[1],10)-1, parseInt(p1[2],10));
    var d2 = new Date(parseInt(p2[0],10), parseInt(p2[1],10)-1, parseInt(p2[2],10));
    var diff = Math.round((d2 - d1) / 86400000);
    var pe = e.endDate.split('-');
    var de = new Date(parseInt(pe[0],10), parseInt(pe[1],10)-1, parseInt(pe[2],10));
    de.setDate(de.getDate() + diff);
    e.endDate = evYmd(de);
  }
  var oldDate = e.date;
  e.date = nd;
  e.updatedAt = new Date().toISOString();
  saveEventDoc(e);
  if (state.gcalConnected) gcalUpsertEvent(e).catch(function(){});
  if (navigator.vibrate) try { navigator.vibrate(10); } catch(ev8) {}
  updateEventsBadge();
  renderEvents();
  renderCalDayList();
  toastAction('' + fmtEvDate(nd, '') + ' へ移動しました ✓', '↩ 元に戻す', function(){
    var e2 = findEvent(id);
    if (!e2) return;
    e2.date = oldDate;
    e2.updatedAt = new Date().toISOString();
    saveEventDoc(e2);
    updateEventsBadge(); renderEvents(); renderCalDayList();
  }, 6000);
}
